# Shell scripts and Docker-related config must always keep LF line endings —
# CRLF silently breaks a Linux container's shebang parsing (e.g.
# "docker-entrypoint.sh: not found" with no other explanation), and this repo
# is edited on Windows with core.autocrlf=true.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
